Subject: [PATCH] java.base: source-runner deadline check and error

Source:  manga_backup_converter source runners (U16), original work
Licence: GPLv2 with the Classpath exception (as java.base)

Adds jdk.internal.misc.SourceRunnerDeadline (the poll target that the
bytecode rewrite pass inserts before backward branches; KTD11 mechanism A)
and SourceRunnerDeadlineError (thrown by that poll, and the object the
embedder passes to JVMTI StopThread for mechanism B).
